<h1 data-copy-en="Emily" data-copy-zh="Emily">Emily</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Café and park visits, early heart-to-hearts, housing actions and current dates." data-copy-zh="咖啡馆与公园拜访、前期谈心、住处动作及当前约会。">Café and park visits, early heart-to-hearts, housing actions and current dates.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Emily</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Christmas_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Pregnancy_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Night_Club_Answer_Guide"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_Answer_Guide"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Repeatable_KTV_and_Night_Club_Invitations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Apartment_Intimacy_Paths_and_Experience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Outings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beach_Day"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Future_Dreams"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beach_Day_and_Future_Dreams"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Emily — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/emily.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Emily — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/emily.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Emily — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Emily has different action lists at the café, the park and the housing block. Several important thresholds are exact point values rather than the next full relationship stage, so check the current action rather than assuming everything waits for Romantic(800).</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_and_Location-Triggered_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Emily</h2><p>Find her at Present → Uptown → Local Café (Interior),07:00–15:00 daily. At Close Friend(200), she also appears in the Uptown park 19:00–21:00 on even days.</p><p>Knock on Emily’s Door is a separate Housing Block action 19:00–23:00 every day at Crush(400); it does not require her park portrait to be present. Its base cost is 180 minutes and 40 Energy, with 3 safe uses per day.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Local Café (Interior)</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Uptown Park</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">even days, 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Close Friend (200)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Route_Order"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Invite to Beach opens at 160 relationship points at the café. The later park heart-to-heart opens at 300 points; the park’s private interaction uses 700 points. These are not all gated at 800.</p><p>For the shared KTV and Night Club invitations, reach Crush(400) and finish Emily Confronts an Old Friend. That earlier café event requires Emily Friend(100),Joey Known(25) and a 12:00–17:00 visit. Invite Emily at the venue 20:00–23:00: the base KTV date is 120 minutes,$150 and 40 Energy; Night Club is 120 minutes,$100 and 30 Energy and requires the corresponding content access. The daily allowance is shared by that venue, not a fresh invite for every character.</p><p>The boardwalk date needs Diane’s completed restoration. Because Emily offers it through her even-day park visit, its effective start window is 19:00–20:00 on even days.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Invite to Beach</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 160</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoo Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fair Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $150; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 12:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); not currently pregnant</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Heart to Heart</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Uptown Park; even days, 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 300</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −20 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Sunset Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Uptown Park; even days, 19:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Restoring the Boardwalk; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; $50; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Apartment_Visit_Entry_and_Branches"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Actions_and_Actual_Rewards"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Service &amp; Emotion Tips gives Charm+1 once at Known(25) with Communication 20 and 30 minutes. Café tips work only through Acquaintance; later social choices use the actions below.</p><p>Emily is the starting character in Kupie Love Training. At Close Friend, she can receive one special Christmas Gift at the café, costing 1 Gift and 30 minutes for+100 base relationship. Her Christmas decorating task needs Friend and 20 minutes. Pregnancy readiness, care and the separate pregnancy-safe housing action are covered in the Pregnancy guide without revealing outcomes.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Knock on Emily's Door</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Residential Block; 19:00–23:00 (location action)</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pregnancy Intimacy</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Residential Block; 19:00–23:00 (location action)</td><td data-label="Requirements">during the supported pregnancy stages</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tip Emily</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger–Acquaintance (0–99 points)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; $10</td><td data-label="Result / limit">4 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Emily</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 07:00–15:00<br/>Uptown Park; even days, 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Service &amp; Emotion Tips</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Communication 20</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Charm +1; base relationship +8; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate to Emily</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Chocolate ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers to Emily</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 07:00–15:00<br/>Uptown Park; even days, 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Emily</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café (Interior); 07:00–15:00<br/>Uptown Park; even days, 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Romantic Walk</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Uptown Park; even days, 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); before pregnancy is showing</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate with Emily</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Uptown Park; even days, 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 700</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>After the café closes, ordinary café gifts and dates cannot be started there. A Voucher fair action with a wider nominal time range is still limited to the café’s 15:00 closing.</p><p>If the park is empty, check both even day and Close Friend. For a housing visit, use the Housing Block action instead of waiting for the park. The current list has no separate Emily minigame button to unlock.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and venue invites</a> · <a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy</a> · <a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie’s Love Training</a> · <a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">Christmas Gifts</a> · <a href="character-diane.html">Diane’s boardwalk</a> · <a href="character-joey.html">Joey</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Christmas_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Pregnancy_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Night_Club_Answer_Guide"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_Answer_Guide"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Repeatable_KTV_and_Night_Club_Invitations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Apartment_Intimacy_Paths_and_Experience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Outings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Beach_Day"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Future_Dreams"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Beach_Day_and_Future_Dreams"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Emily 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/emily.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Emily 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/emily.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Emily 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Emily在咖啡馆、公园和住宅街区提供不同的动作。几项重要门槛检查具体点数，而不是下一完整关系阶段，不能默认都要等到浪漫感（800）。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_and_Location-Triggered_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>现代 → 上城区 → 本地咖啡馆（内部），每天07:00—15:00可找到她。达到亲密朋友（200）后，双数日19:00—21:00也会出现在上城公园。</p><p>「敲Emily的门」是住宅街区独立的地点动作，迷恋（400）后每天19:00—23:00可用，不依赖她是否正在公园显示头像。基础消耗180分钟、精力40，每日安全额度3次。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">本地咖啡馆（内部）</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">上城公园</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">双数日，19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Route_Order"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>咖啡馆的海滩邀请在关系点数160时开放，后来的公园谈心要求300点，公园的私下互动则要求700点，并非都卡在800。</p><p>共用KTV与夜总会邀约需要迷恋（400），并完成「Emily偶遇老友」。这段前置咖啡馆事件要求Emily朋友（100）、Joey已知（25），以及12:00—17:00到访。之后于20:00—23:00在对应场所邀请：KTV基础120分钟、财富150、精力40；夜总会基础120分钟、财富100、精力30，并要求相应内容权限。每日邀约额度按场所共用，不是换个人就重新得到一次。</p><p>木板路约会要求Diane完成修复。Emily从双数日公园行程提供该动作，所以实际开始时段是双数日19:00—20:00。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">邀请去海滩</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数160</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">180分钟；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">动物园约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富100；−50 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游园会约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富150；−45 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 12:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；当前未怀孕</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">心与心的谈话</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">上城公园; 双数日，19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数300</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；−20 精力；+10 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滨栈道日落约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">上城公园; 双数日，19:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：重修海滨木栈道；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；财富50；−30 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Apartment_Visit_Entry_and_Branches"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Actions_and_Actual_Rewards"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>已知（25）且沟通20时，可花30分钟接受一次服务与情绪建议，永久增加魅力1。咖啡馆小费只适用于相识及更早阶段，后续使用下表的其他社交动作。</p><p>Emily是Kupie 的爱之训练的初始角色。亲密朋友时可在咖啡馆收取一次特殊圣诞礼物，消耗1份礼物和30分钟，基础关系+100；她的圣诞装饰任务要求朋友及20分钟。生育准备、照护与另一个孕期安全住处动作见生育指南，本页不展开结果。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">敲 Emily 的门</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">住宅街区; 19:00–23:00（地点动作）</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">180分钟；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与孕期Emily亲密相伴</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">住宅街区; 19:00–23:00（地点动作）</td><td data-label="条件">处于此动作支持的孕期阶段</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">给 Emily 小费</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人至相识（0—99点）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；财富10</td><td data-label="结果／限制">4次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Emily 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 07:00–15:00<br/>上城公园; 双数日，19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">服务与情绪建议</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；沟通20</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">魅力 +1；基础关系+8；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力给Emily</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 07:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；巧克力 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送鲜花给Emily</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 07:00–15:00<br/>上城公园; 双数日，19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Emily 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 07:00–15:00<br/>上城公园; 双数日，19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">浪漫散步</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">上城公园; 双数日，19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；尚未显怀</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Emily亲密相处</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">上城公园; 双数日，19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数700</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>咖啡馆关门后，不能继续在那里开始普通赠礼或约会。凭兑换券的游乐场动作即使标有更宽的时段，实际仍受15:00关门限制。</p><p>公园没人时，检查双数日与亲密朋友条件。要拜访住处，使用住宅街区地点动作，不必等公园头像。当前动作列表没有另一个需要解锁的Emily小游戏按钮。</p></section>
